==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|ber}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|beri}}, originally a neuter. The feminine gender is from {{etyl|gml|de}} {{m|gml|bere}} ({{g|f}}). Cognate with {{cog|en|berry}} and eventually {{cog|nl|bes}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈbeːʁə/|lang=de}}
